{"ref":"BDB, צָפַף","hw":"צָפַף","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">צָפַף</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. </strong><br><strong>Pilp.</strong>  <strong> chirp, peep (</strong>onomatop.; NH Pilp. id.<em>;</em> JAram. <span dir=\"rtl\">צַפְצֵף</span> <em>chirp;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">صُفْصُفٌ</span> <em>sparrow</em>, etc.<strong>)</strong>;—Impf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּצַפְצֵף</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.4\">Is 29:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.1\">1</a> s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲצַפְצֵף</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.14\">38:14</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְצַפְצֵף</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.14\">10:14</a>, pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמְצַפְצְפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.19\">8:19</a>;—<em>chirp, peep:</em> <strong>1.</strong>  of birds <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.14\">Is 10:14</a> (fig. of conquered peoples); of mourning, <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּסוּס</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲצ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.14\">38:14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶהְגֶּה כַּיּוֹנָה</span>). <strong>2.</strong>  of spirits, ghosts <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.19\">Is 8:19</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמַּהְגִּים</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵעָפָר אִמְרָתֵךְ תְּצ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.4\">29:4</a> (like a spirit’s).","next":"BDB, צַפְצָפָה","prev":"BDB, צְפִיעָה"}